---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';

const schema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "AboutPage",
  "name": "About MegaLancer",
  "url": "https://www.megalancer.online/about/"
};
---

<Page
  title="About MegaLancer"
  description="MegaLancer builds free calculators and tools for freelancers, founders, and finance professionals. Learn about our mission and methodology."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.megalancer.online/about/"
  schema={schema}
>
  <article class="trust-page">
    <h1>About MegaLancer</h1>

    <h2>What is MegaLancer?</h2>
    <p>MegaLancer is a free collection of calculators, document generators, and financial tools built for independent professionals — freelancers, consultants, founders, and small business owners who need professional-grade tools without paying for software they use twice a year.</p>
    <p>Founded in 2024, MegaLancer is built and maintained by a small team of developers, financial analysts, and legal writers who understand the day-to-day challenges of running a freelance business. Our goal is to make professional-quality tools accessible to everyone, regardless of budget.</p>
    <p>Every tool on this site runs entirely in your browser. No data is stored on our servers. No account is required. The calculations use publicly available formulas from the IRS, the Social Security Administration, the Bureau of Labor Statistics, and standard financial mathematics.</p>

    <h2>Editorial policy and content review</h2>
    <p>All content published on MegaLancer — including tool descriptions, blog posts, and educational articles — is reviewed by our editorial team before publication. Our review process includes fact-checking against primary sources, verification of mathematical formulas, and legal review where applicable.</p>
    <p>Blog posts and educational content are written by subject-matter contributors and reviewed by the editorial team for accuracy, clarity, and completeness. We correct errors promptly and note significant updates at the bottom of each article.</p>
    <p>If you spot an error or believe something is inaccurate, please <a href="/contact/">contact us</a> so we can review and correct it.</p>

    <h2>Our methodology</h2>
    <p>Every calculator is built from primary sources. Tax brackets come from IRS Publication 15. BMI formulas follow WHO standards. Mortgage calculations use the standard amortization formula used by lenders. Where estimates are involved — such as credit score simulations — we note this clearly with a disclaimer on the tool page.</p>

    <h2>Limitations and disclaimers</h2>
    <p>MegaLancer provides informational tools only. Nothing on this site constitutes financial, legal, medical, or tax advice. For decisions involving significant money, health, or legal obligations, consult a licensed professional. Calculator results are estimates and may not reflect your exact situation.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>We'd love to hear from you. Whether you have a question, found a bug, want to suggest a new tool, or are interested in contributing content, reach out through our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
    <p>Email: <a href="mailto:hello@megalancer.online">hello@megalancer.online</a></p>
  </article>
</Page>
